# startup — the first thing the program reads.
#
# On launch, before anything else, First Person Spellcraft reads input/ to learn
# how to begin. This seed file exists so that "read input/ first" is true even
# on day zero, when there is nothing yet to run.
#
# When the engine exists, expect keys like:
#   world      = which square-room map to load
#   input_mode = dual-mouse | single-mouse | (stretch) bci-ceiling-headset
#   role       = player | ncp   (are you aiming as a New Character Person?)
#
# For now: hello, engine. Wake up gently. Read this, then greet the world.
